    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3469cdbaa6c1d021c680cca8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石才刚留我一人独自离席，\n便有许多与会人士前来攀谈。\n我以坚定的态度一一回答各种问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "10c7df8ea1f5a40d91ae865fb763f6abf4c9b2e95c18410e690a4a68f601c5c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085109.json",
      "json_path": [
