      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过……\n担任知名的“华丽一族”的训练员，\n想必承受了不少压力吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "efecbb0cea13e9fb9549bd7560d043d5e8d39a4e82e2ecaeaae6e9fbc4059d56",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
